* Publication timestamp.
* Responsible reviewer.

Acceptance Criteria

* The original report remains identifiable as superseded or retracted.
* The corrected version is traceable.
* The platform does not silently replace the original artifact.
* Downstream APIs and downloads can identify the correction.
* Communication is based on verified facts.
* Marketing cannot suppress a material correction merely because it is commercially inconvenient.

